  "text": "Silver Price History\nThe LBMA London fix for silver, from 1968 through 2026-09-25, in USD, GBP and EUR. Explore the full history below, or jump to any year.\nGold\nSilver\nPlatinum\nPalladium\nUSD\nGBP\nEUR\nAll (1968→)\n30Y\n20Y\n10Y\n5Y\nLatest (2026-09-25)\n$65.02\nHighest monthly sample\n$103\nJan 2026\nSample high\n$103\nJan 2026\nSample low\n$1.31\nOct 1971\nSource: LBMA fixing (PM where applicable), per troy ounce. Last available fixing per month; latest month may be incomplete. EUR begins 1999. See the methodology for sampling limits.\nExplore the highest monthly observations →\nSilver price by decade\n2020s\n2010s\n2000s\n1990s\n1980s\n1970s\n1960s\nSilver price by year\n2026\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009\n2008\n2007\n2006\n2005\n2004\n2003\n2002\n2001\n2000\n1999\n1998\n1997\n1996\n1995\n1994\n1993\n1992\n1991\n1990\n1989\n1988\n1987\n1986\n1985\n1984\n1983\n1982\n1981\n1980\n1979\n1978\n1977\n1976\n1975\n1974\n1973\n1972\n1971\n1970\n1969\n1968\nReady to act on the price? See live silver quotes on the\nspot dashboard\nor\nshop silver bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
